The clinical records in `events/` are derived from HL7/CodeX mCODE Test Data,
synthetic records generated with Synthea and released by HL7/CodeX without
privacy or usage restrictions. They contain no real patient data.

  https://confluence.hl7.org/spaces/COD/pages/80119851/mCODE+Test+Data
  https://github.com/synthetichealth/synthea

The derived material in this directory — the questions, gold answers, valid
answers, anchor events, rationales, grading rubrics, templates, and the cohort
manifest — is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License.

You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit, link to the license, and
indicate if changes were made.

